  "slug": "blueberry-cloud-mug-cake",
  "title": "Blueberry Cloud Mug Cake",
  "blurb": "A light, fluffy single-serving cake made in the microwave with cream cheese and fresh blueberries.",
  "steps": [
    "Break the egg into a mug and beat it with a fork until smooth.",
    "Add the cream cheese and mash it into the egg until mostly combined.",
    "Stir in the baking powder and nutmeg, then gently fold in the blueberries.",
    "Microwave on high for 60 to 90 seconds until the cake has risen and set in the centre.",
    "Let it stand for a minute before eating straight from the mug."
